                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="ANIMAL FOOD. — The staple food of the Reindeer Chukchee is reindeer-"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l3" HPOS="366" VPOS="1091" WIDTH="1774" HEIGHT="58" BASELINE="368 1134 2140 1125" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="368 1134 368 1149 2138 1141 2140 1125 2135 1097 814 1091 812 1091 366 1104 368 1134"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="meat, and that of the Maritime people, “sea-meat,” — the meat of sea-mam-"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l4" HPOS="366" VPOS="1149" WIDTH="1774" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="368 1195 2140 1188" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="368 1195 368 1210 2138 1203 2140 1188 2135 1158 977 1149 975 1149 973 1149 936 1160 435 1151 433 1151 366 1162 368 1195"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="mals. On the whole, the latter is more relished by the whole people, because"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l5" HPOS="366" VPOS="1206" WIDTH="1774" HEIGHT="62" BASELINE="368 1255 2140 1249" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="368 1255 368 1268 2138 1264 2140 1249 2138 1219 2088 1206 2086 1206 2084 1206 1915 1216 1893 1206 1891 1206 1889 1206 1886 1206 1865 1216 1841 1206 1839 1206 1837 1206 1834 1206 1791 1216 1761 1206 1759 1206 1756 1206 1754 1206 1726 1216 1698 1206 1696 1206 1694 1206 1692 1206 1670 1216 1596 1206 1594 1206 1488 1219 1466 1208 1464 1208 1462 1208 1289 1219 1237 1208 1235 1208 1232 1208 1230 1208 1215 1219 1185 1208 1183 1208 1180 1208 1178 1208 1146 1219 1055 1208 1053 1208 1050 1208 1020 1219 990 1208 988 1208 986 1208 983 1208 953 1221 799 1210 797 1210 795 1210 769 1221 754 1210 752 1210 749 1210 747 1210 745 1210 697 1221 533 1210 531 1210 366 1219 368 1255"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="it is fatter, and because it formed the chief food of their forefathers. The"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l6" HPOS="366" VPOS="1268" WIDTH="1776" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="368 1314 2142 1307" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="368 1314 368 1329 2140 1322 2142 1307 2138 1277 960 1268 957 1268 955 1268 912 1279 418 1271 416 1271 366 1281 368 1314"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="reindeer-breeders have quite a liking for sea-food. This peculiarity may also"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l7" HPOS="368" VPOS="1325" WIDTH="1774" HEIGHT="62" BASELINE="370 1377 2142 1368" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="370 1377 370 1387 2140 1381 2142 1368 2140 1338 2107 1325 2105 1325 2103 1325 1873 1335 1769 1325 1767 1325 1650 1338 1315 1327 1313 1327 1252 1340 1209 1329 1206 1329 1204 1329 1202 1329 1174 1340 1152 1329 1150 1329 1148 1329 1146 1329 1102 1340 996 1329 994 1329 860 1340 778 1331 775 1331 773 1331 771 1331 758 1342 704 1331 702 1331 700 1331 672 1342 659 1331 656 1331 654 1331 652 1331 368 1338 370 1377"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="be observed in the traditions of the tribe. In the tale of Elendi and his"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l8" HPOS="366" VPOS="1385" WIDTH="1776" HEIGHT="63" BASELINE="368 1433 2142 1426" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="368 1433 368 1448 2140 1442 2142 1426 2140 1398 2112 1385 2109 1385 2107 1385 2105 1385 2079 1396 2064 1385 2062 1385 2060 1385 2058 1385 2055 1385 2027 1396 1930 1385 1928 1385 1817 1396 1739 1385 1737 1385 1735 1385 1705 1396 1661 1385 1659 1385 1657 1385 1655 1385 1633 1396 1603 1385 1601 1385 1598 1385 1596 1385 1594 1385 1579 1396 1553 1385 1551 1385 1549 1385 1468 1398 1137 1387 1135 1387 1133 1387 1094 1398 1042 1387 1040 1387 983 1398 962 1387 960 1387 957 1387 843 1400 518 1390 516 1390 513 1390 511 1390 494 1403 366 1403 368 1433"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="sons the old man and his wife risk the safety of their herd in sending their"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l9" HPOS="368" VPOS="1450" WIDTH="1774" HEIGHT="59" BASELINE="370 1494 2142 1487" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="370 1494 370 1509 2140 1502 2142 1487 2138 1459 979 1450 977 1450 890 1461 509 1452 507 1452 368 1463 370 1494"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="sons to procure some sea-food. After a while, when the enemies have been"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l10" HPOS="368" VPOS="1509" WIDTH="1772" HEIGHT="62" BASELINE="370 1550 2140 1545" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="370 1550 370 1567 2135 1571 2140 1545 2135 1517 390 1509 388 1509 386 1509 383 1509 368 1515 370 1550"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="defeated, the old man is described as sitting in the sleeping-room, eating"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l11" HPOS="370" VPOS="1565" WIDTH="1417" HEIGHT="63" BASELINE="373 1613 1787 1606" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="373 1613 373 1628 1785 1621 1787 1606 1785 1578 1744 1565 1741 1565 1739 1565 1737 1565 1711 1576 1503 1565 1501 1565 1442 1576 1365 1565 1362 1565 1254 1578 1239 1567 1237 1567 1235 1567 1232 1567 1230 1567 1204 1578 1102 1567 1100 1567 1007 1578 973 1567 970 1567 968 1567 901 1578 864 1567 862 1567 860 1567 858 1567 834 1580 370 1580 373 1613"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="blubber, the oil dripping down from both sides of his mouth.¹"/>
                    </TextLine>
<TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l12" HPOS="474" VPOS="1626" WIDTH="1670" HEIGHT="62" BASELINE="477 1673 2144 1667" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="477 1673 477 1688 2142 1682 2144 1667 2140 1634 1031 1626 1029 1626 1027 1626 1025 1626 1007 1636 487 1628 485 1628 483 1628 481 1628 481 1630 474 1634 477 1673"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="I myself witnessed that Reindeer Chukchee who had not had any blubber"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l13" HPOS="366" VPOS="1697" WIDTH="1780" HEIGHT="65" BASELINE="368 1734 2146 1727" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="368 1734 368 1762 440 1747 949 1760 951 1760 953 1760 1005 1745 1152 1758 1154 1758 1282 1745 1330 1758 1332 1758 1334 1758 1336 1758 1339 1758 1358 1745 1668 1755 1670 1755 1672 1755 1700 1742 1839 1755 1841 1755 1843 1755 1871 1742 2064 1755 2066 1755 2144 1740 2146 1727 2140 1697 366 1701 368 1734"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="for a long time develop a craving for it, and are ready to pay extravagant"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l14" HPOS="366" VPOS="1745" WIDTH="1778" HEIGHT="71" BASELINE="368 1794 2144 1786" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="368 1794 368 1816 2142 1799 2144 1786 2140 1758 1728 1745 1726 1745 1650 1758 1319 1747 1317 1747 1250 1760 856 1749 853 1749 851 1749 849 1749 834 1760 537 1751 535 1751 533 1751 505 1762 420 1751 418 1751 416 1751 366 1764 368 1794"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="prices for it. For this reason every spring, when the traders from the sea-"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l15" HPOS="366" VPOS="1803" WIDTH="1778" HEIGHT="67" BASELINE="368 1855 2144 1846" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="368 1855 368 1870 2142 1862 2144 1846 2140 1812 1830 1803 1828 1803 1826 1803 1824 1803 1808 1814 1668 1805 1666 1805 1663 1805 1618 1816 1592 1805 1590 1805 1588 1805 1531 1816 1499 1805 1497 1805 1494 1805 1492 1805 1455 1816 1265 1805 1263 1805 1198 1820 931 1820 845 1807 843 1807 617 1820 546 1810 544 1810 366 1823 368 1855"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="coast visit the Reindeer camps, a continual feasting begins, and blubber and"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l16" HPOS="368" VPOS="1870" WIDTH="1583" HEIGHT="57" BASELINE="370 1911 1951 1907" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="370 1911 370 1927 1949 1922 1951 1907 1947 1879 539 1870 537 1870 368 1881 370 1911"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="meat of sea-animals are offered to every one as the best of dainties."/>
                    </TextLine>
<TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l17" HPOS="474" VPOS="1924" WIDTH="1670" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="477 1970 2144 1965" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="477 1970 477 1985 2142 1981 2144 1965 2140 1935 1310 1924 1308 1924 1306 1924 1269 1935 498 1927 496 1927 494 1927 474 1935 477 1970"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="On the other hand, the Maritime Chukchee and the Eskimo value rein-"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l18" HPOS="368" VPOS="1987" WIDTH="1776" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="370 2033 2144 2024" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="370 2033 370 2048 2142 2039 2144 2024 2140 1994 819 1987 817 1987 736 1998 390 1989 388 1989 386 1989 383 1989 368 1996 370 2033"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="deer-meat very highly, and call it the “sweet food of reindeer-breeders.” In"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l19" HPOS="370" VPOS="2046" WIDTH="1776" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="373 2093 2146 2085" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="373 2093 373 2106 2144 2098 2146 2085 2142 2054 1258 2046 1256 2046 1254 2046 1206 2056 817 2048 814 2048 812 2048 782 2059 392 2050 390 2050 388 2050 386 2050 370 2056 373 2093"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="their tales it is often praised beyond any other kind of human food. The"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l20" HPOS="373" VPOS="2104" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="63" BASELINE="375 2152 2144 2145" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="375 2152 375 2167 2142 2160 2144 2145 2140 2117 1967 2104 1964 2104 1962 2104 1960 2104 1943 2117 1843 2117 1815 2104 1813 2104 1811 2104 1808 2104 1772 2115 1739 2104 1737 2104 1735 2104 1733 2104 1731 2104 1718 2115 1689 2104 1687 2104 1685 2104 1542 2117 1447 2106 1445 2106 1442 2106 1414 2117 1328 2106 1326 2106 1159 2117 1046 2106 1044 2106 1042 2106 1009 2117 373 2117 375 2152"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Maritime people undertake long expeditions by sea and land to obtain a"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l21" HPOS="370" VPOS="2162" WIDTH="1776" HEIGHT="65" BASELINE="373 2217 2146 2206" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="373 2217 373 2227 2144 2219 2146 2206 2142 2175 1808 2162 1806 2162 1804 2162 1802 2162 1780 2175 1492 2165 1490 2165 1395 2178 1349 2167 1347 2167 1345 2167 1081 2180 1061 2169 1059 2169 1057 2169 1055 2169 938 2180 788 2169 786 2169 678 2182 472 2171 470 2171 370 2184 373 2217"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="supply, and occasionally trade some of it to the Eskimo of St. Lawrence"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l22" HPOS="370" VPOS="2223" WIDTH="1774" HEIGHT="65" BASELINE="373 2271 2144 2264" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="373 2271 373 2288 2142 2282 2144 2264 2140 2236 1958 2236 1930 2223 1928 2223 1925 2223 1923 2223 1886 2234 1847 2223 1845 2223 1843 2223 1724 2234 1698 2223 1696 2223 1694 2223 1692 2223 1689 2223 1672 2236 1551 2236 1497 2225 1494 2225 1492 2225 1462 2236 1250 2225 1248 2225 1170 2236 1137 2225 1135 2225 1133 2225 1131 2225 1094 2236 1022 2225 1020 2225 1018 2225 994 2236 964 2225 962 2225 960 2225 957 2225 923 2238 853 2227 851 2227 786 2238 739 2227 736 2227 734 2227 732 2227 704 2238 689 2227 687 2227 685 2227 682 2227 680 2227 643 2238 617 2227 615 2227 613 2227 370 2236 373 2271"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Island and of the Diomede Islands. Although the meat is usually in a very"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l23" HPOS="370" VPOS="2292" WIDTH="1776" HEIGHT="65" BASELINE="373 2336 2146 2323" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="373 2336 373 2357 2144 2338 2146 2323 2142 2295 667 2292 665 2292 663 2292 639 2303 542 2295 539 2295 370 2305 373 2336"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="poor state, it brings quite a good price. Generally it is bartered for the"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l24" HPOS="370" VPOS="2347" WIDTH="1776" HEIGHT="64" BASELINE="373 2392 2146 2383" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="373 2392 373 2407 1700 2411 1702 2411 2144 2398 2146 2383 2142 2355 1258 2347 1256 2347 1254 2347 1228 2357 843 2349 840 2349 782 2360 550 2351 548 2351 370 2362 373 2392"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="meat of sea-mammals, because one of the principles of trade in those coun-"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l25" HPOS="370" VPOS="2409" WIDTH="1776" HEIGHT="59" BASELINE="373 2453 2146 2444" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="373 2453 373 2468 2144 2459 2146 2444 2142 2411 414 2409 412 2409 409 2409 370 2420 373 2453"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="tries is the interchange of similar articles whenever possible. Cotton is traded"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l26" HPOS="368" VPOS="2463" WIDTH="1778" HEIGHT="65" BASELINE="370 2513 2146 2505" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="370 2513 370 2528 2144 2520 2146 2505 2142 2474 1702 2463 1700 2463 1698 2463 1696 2463 1676 2474 1349 2466 1347 2466 1252 2476 388 2470 386 2470 383 2470 381 2470 368 2476 370 2513"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="for skins, sugar for reindeer-tongues, ready-made shirts for ready-made skin"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l27" HPOS="370" VPOS="2539" WIDTH="245" HEIGHT="59" BASELINE="373 2570 615 2574" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="373 2570 370 2583 494 2598 496 2598 613 2587 615 2574 615 2544 373 2539 373 2570"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="coats, etc."/>
                    </TextLine>
<TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l28" HPOS="481" VPOS="2580" WIDTH="1665" HEIGHT="74" BASELINE="483 2632 2146 2621" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="483 2632 483 2645 791 2654 793 2654 795 2654 817 2643 1020 2652 1022 2652 1300 2641 1315 2652 1317 2652 1319 2652 1321 2654 1425 2654 1425 2652 1549 2650 1551 2650 1553 2650 1566 2639 1618 2650 1620 2650 1622 2650 1624 2650 1640 2639 1672 2650 1674 2650 1676 2650 2144 2637 2146 2621 2142 2593 1893 2580 1891 2580 1787 2593 1503 2583 1501 2583 1391 2598 481 2598 483 2632"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="The Reindeer Chukchee have no opportunity to consume fish in any"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l29" HPOS="370" VPOS="2641" WIDTH="1781" HEIGHT="65" BASELINE="373 2693 2151 2684" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="373 2693 373 2706 2148 2699 2151 2684 2146 2654 1904 2641 1902 2641 1899 2641 1897 2641 1884 2652 1858 2641 1856 2641 1854 2641 1795 2652 1769 2641 1767 2641 1765 2641 1763 2641 1761 2641 1746 2652 1676 2643 1674 2643 1590 2654 1564 2643 1562 2643 1559 2643 1557 2643 1555 2643 1538 2656 1416 2656 1354 2643 1352 2643 1282 2654 1265 2643 1263 2643 1261 2643 1258 2643 1256 2643 1217 2656 1196 2645 1193 2645 1191 2645 1189 2645 1154 2656 1133 2645 1131 2645 1128 2645 975 2656 908 2645 905 2645 903 2645 901 2645 886 2656 784 2647 782 2647 780 2647 741 2658 477 2647 474 2647 370 2660 373 2693"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="considerable quantity. The Russianized natives, on the other hand, live almost"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l30" HPOS="373" VPOS="2702" WIDTH="1775" HEIGHT="67" BASELINE="375 2754 2148 2743" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="375 2754 375 2769 2146 2758 2148 2743 2142 2712 2006 2712 1975 2702 1973 2702 1971 2702 1811 2712 1793 2702 1791 2702 1789 2702 1787 2702 1785 2702 1759 2715 1464 2704 1462 2704 1460 2704 1425 2717 1111 2706 1109 2706 1107 2706 1076 2719 886 2708 884 2708 882 2708 853 2719 823 2708 821 2708 819 2708 723 2721 689 2710 687 2710 685 2710 509 2721 427 2710 425 2710 373 2721 375 2754"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="solely on fish; and therefore the Chukchee who live near these settlements"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l31" HPOS="375" VPOS="2756" WIDTH="1758" HEIGHT="75" BASELINE="377 2814 2133 2799" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="377 2814 377 2829 1378 2831 1380 2831 1382 2831 1421 2821 1627 2829 1629 2829 1631 2829 1666 2818 1878 2827 1880 2827 2131 2814 2133 2799 2127 2756 2051 2769 1886 2758 1884 2758 1882 2758 1880 2758 1860 2771 1731 2760 1728 2760 1657 2771 1629 2760 1627 2760 1624 2760 1622 2760 1620 2760 1605 2773 1538 2762 1536 2762 1533 2762 1531 2762 1512 2775 1371 2775 1347 2764 1345 2764 1343 2764 1276 2775 1191 2764 1189 2764 1115 2777 1012 2767 1009 2767 944 2777 836 2769 834 2769 832 2769 830 2769 817 2780 780 2769 778 2769 775 2769 656 2780 548 2771 546 2771 544 2771 542 2771 526 2782 420 2771 418 2771 416 2771 375 2782 377 2814"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="utilize fish, which they reckon as belonging to what is called “alien food.”²"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l32" HPOS="377" VPOS="2821" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="67" BASELINE="379 2873 2148 2862" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="379 2873 379 2886 1791 2888 1793 2888 1795 2888 1843 2877 2146 2877 2148 2862 2144 2834 1915 2821 1912 2821 1910 2821 1880 2831 1847 2821 1845 2821 1843 2821 1737 2834 1523 2823 1520 2823 1414 2836 1185 2825 1183 2825 1083 2838 1022 2827 1020 2827 1018 2827 981 2838 888 2827 745 2827 743 2827 741 2827 739 2827 723 2840 639 2829 637 2829 377 2836 379 2873"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="The Maritime Chukchee also consider fish as rather poor diet.³ They con-"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-249_l33" HPOS="373" VPOS="2892" WIDTH="1775" HEIGHT="56" BASELINE="375 2929 2148 2920" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="375 2929 375 2948 2146 2940 2148 2920 2142 2892 373 2899 375 2929"/>
